    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609490/extras/767df3ce54d699f10c11a6bec35c2658.avif?t=1755071079\" width=605 height=229 /></span><br>Get to know all the foxes, because each of them deserves attention. Dreamy, aggressive, funny, sweet - you will find a fox you like!<br><br>Easy win: Keyboard <strong>\u0421trl+D</strong> - Complete Level<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609490/extras/1388c2c240362eccc43ee2c57bac70c7.avif?t=1755071079\" width=605 height=355 /></span><br>In the game, your goal is to collect the puzzle in order to restore the pictures. (\u25d5\u203f\u25d5)\u2661<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83e\udd8a   Live2D dynamic character<br></li><li>\ud83e\udd8a   CG Gallery Mode<br></li><li>\ud83e\udd8a   Well-drawn CGs<br></li><li>\ud83e\udd8a   Relaxing music<br></li><li>\ud83e\udd8a   Puzzle game</li></ul>",
